    "description": "<p><b>Overview:</b></p><p>1. The licking mat is a unique form of pet slow-feeder dog bowl for the dog and puppies.<br/>2. The lick mats have different textures whose design effectively reduces the speed of a pet’s eating <br/>3. It cleans the pet's tongue and promotes healthier teeth, which provide dental care and improve health digestion effectively.<b><br/></b></p><p><br/></p><p><b>Product information:</b><br/>Specifications: Black small licking pad, Lake Blue small licking pad, small size in purple licking pad, dark gray small licking pad, sky blue small licking pad, milky white small licking pad, small size light green licking pad, Slow Food pad, square pad, large, black licking pad, large lake blue licking pad, large purple licking pad, large gray licking pad, large sky blue licking pad, large milky white licking pad, large light green licking pad<br/>Material: Silicone<br/>Product Name: pet slow food mat<br/>Category: Pet tableware<br/>Function: multifunctional pet-licking pad<br/>Small size: 30 * 20 * 4.2cm<br/>Large size: 43 * 28.8 * 4.2cm<br/></p>\n <b>Packing List: </b>\n <br/>Pet licking mat*1\n \n <b>Product Image:</b>\n <br/>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/cbffdf24-0b63-4da3-bb93-4d7d06397b2e_trans.jpeg\"/>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/8d12bd88-5a70-40e5-8e0e-cc5e8bf9f63b_trans.jpeg\"/>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/6286bfd1-829f-4eb7-abdc-89cc5657c165.jpg\"/>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/da0b4947-eb20-4b62-9f49-ce483c9e97de.jpg\"/>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/75486d90-ae2a-4e68-9e88-e6dc14718aeb.jpg\"/>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/ee4aece4-b340-40ea-9472-715f456bae57.jpg\"/>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/cc458966-ea6c-4730-b82d-61688d0e9593.jpg\"/>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/10e5ee45-a94e-4877-a8df-5b5883a83fc1.jpg\"/>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/154d4f11-5e30-4471-a4d3-628eadc1cfe1.jpg\"/>",
